{
  "_about": [
    "Eight icons for the stage cards, as SVG markup fragments: the inside of",
    "each uploaded file, with its own viewBox carried along. Each file was",
    "drawn on a different grid (32, 64, 512), so the viewBox belongs to the",
    "icon and not to the file - the page reads it per card and the square .ic",
    "box plus preserveAspectRatio scales each one undistorted.",
    "",
    "  _note     which stage it is",
    "  _source   the file it came from",
    "  viewBox   that icon's own coordinate system",
    "  svg       the markup as drawn, except where _edit says otherwise",
    "  _edit     present only where the artwork was changed, and what changed",
    "",
    "The artwork carries its own fills, so nothing here inherits the card's",
    "colour; the current stage is still marked by the card's border and tint.",
    "An icon with its own <defs> keeps them inside `svg`: the ids are unique",
    "across the eight, so inlining them all on one page is safe.",
    "",
    "Attributes use single quotes so the markup stays readable inside JSON;",
    "double quotes work too if you escape them as \\\".",
    "",
    "Keys are unchanged from the drawn set, so poprocess.json needs no edit."
  ],
  "defaultViewBox": "0 0 64 64",
